# Coverage output. `backend/coverage.xml` is the per-run report (CI uploads it as
# an artifact); the published report is the normalised copy committed at the
# repository root, `coverage.xml`, which is what a reader — and the darkfactory
# quality lane — parses from the default branch. It must stay tracked.
.coverage
